.","citation_ids":["cite.step.choice_of_modulus"],"evidence_ids":[],"id":"step.choice_of_modulus","kind":"claim","label":"The choice of modulus","locator":"Proof of Theorem 1.2, 'Choosing the modulus', p. 4","source_id":"paper.short.pdf","statement":"With $p_*=\\max P$ and $H\\ge2p_*$, set $Q=L\\prod_{p\\in P}p^{\\lfloor\\log_pH\\rfloor}$ and $G=\\lfloor H/p_*\\rfloor$. For $a\\notin F$ with $h(a)\\le H$ we have $h(a)\\mid Q$, hence $(Q,a)\\ge h(a)$; for $h(a)>H$ we have $(Q,a)\\ge G$ instead.","status":"unverified"},"ref":"sha256:f31aeb6174afd909393ada9bc329cd29dc9b1b6a0de8f72a49f18ab372947af5/nodes/step.choice_of_modulus","relations":[{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:f31aeb6174afd909393ada9bc329cd29dc9b1b6a0de8f72a49f18ab372947af5/nodes/step.choice_of_modulus","id":"sha256:f31aeb6174afd909393ada9bc329cd29dc9b1b6a0de8f72a49f18ab372947af5/edges/%5B%22step.choice_of_modulus%22%2C%22step.orbit_bound%22%2C%22supports%22%5D","kind":"supports","record_ref":"sha256:f31aeb6174afd909393ada9bc329cd29dc9b1b6a0de8f72a49f18ab372947af5/edges/%5B%22step.choice_of_modulus%22%2C%22step.orbit_bound%22%2C%22supports%22%5D","semantic_class":"curated_argument_support","to":"sha256:f31aeb6174afd909393ada9bc329cd29dc9b1b6a0de8f72a49f18ab372947af5/nodes/step.orbit_bound"},{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:f31aeb6174afd909393ada9bc329cd29dc9b1b6a0de8f72a49f18ab372947af5/nodes/step.combined_bound","id":"sha256:f31aeb6174afd909393ada9bc329cd29dc9b1b6a0de8f72a49f18ab372947af5/edges/%5B%22step.combined_bound%22%2C%22step.choice_of_modulus%22%2C%22supports%22%5D","kind":"supports","record_ref":"sha256:f31aeb6174afd909393ada9bc329cd29dc9b1b6a0de8f72a49f18ab372947af5/edges/%5B%22step.combined_bound%22%2C%22step.choice_of_modulus%22%2C%22supports%22%5D","semantic_class":"curated_argument_support","to":"sha256:f31aeb6174afd909393ada9bc329cd29dc9b1b6a0de8f72a49f18ab372947af5/nodes/step.choice_of_modulus"},{"derived":true,"family":"provenance","from":"sha256:f31